'''Stagbreaker''' is the first two-handed [[Clubs|club]].

* The primary attack slams the ground ''(after a lengthy swing delay)'', dealing damage and knocking back everything in a spherical area of effect with a radius of 4 meters.
* It has no secondary attack.

